td>07:30 – 18:00</td></tr><tr><th>Last order</th><td>17:30</td></tr></table><div><div class=\"ks-ph\" style=\"min-height:260px\" data-l=\"Map (缺图)\"></div><p style=\"margin-top:16px;line-height:1.9\">12 Jalan Contoh, 50000 Kuala Lumpur (replace). Two minutes from the station, behind the pharmacy. Six seats, no reservations.</p></div></div></section></div>","faq":"<div tabindex=\"-1\" data-dl-content><section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.12em\">よくある質問</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Can I reserve a seat?</summary><p>We have six seats and don't take reservations. Groups of four or more, please call.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have decaf?</summary><p>Yes, one decaf blend, by the cup or the bag.</p></details><details><summary>Can I work on a laptop?</summary><p>For an hour at the counter when it's quiet. Weekends, please leave it at home.</p></details></div></section></div>","privacy":"<div tabindex=\"-1\" data-dl-content><section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section></div>","404":"<div tabindex=\"-1\" data-dl-content><section class=\"ks-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(60px,10vw,140px)\"><div class=\"ks-sign\" style=\"display:inline-grid;margin-bottom:20px\">準備中</div><h1 style=\"font:400 clamp(70px,14vw,180px) var(--f-head)\">404</h1><h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 26px;font:400 28px var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.1em\">そのページは売り切れです。</h2><a class=\"ks-btn\" href=\"{